1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,186
Beyond a plain, we climbed a plateau and found a tiny oasis.

2
00:00:04,136 --> 00:00:08,159
A superficial inspection will not explain this,’ Mira warned.

3
00:00:08,159 --> 00:00:11,159
The village’s water system needed an upgrade.

4
00:00:11,159 --> 00:00:16,659
Broken pipes could make conditions deteriorate, aggravate shortages and degrade the land.

5
00:00:16,659 --> 00:00:19,909
Heavy rain could also erode the exposed ground.

6
00:00:19,909 --> 00:00:22,659
We found a blocked pipe and called the team.

7
00:00:22,659 --> 00:00:26,079
While waiting, I opened our meteorology notebook.

8
00:00:26,079 --> 00:00:30,590
Climate describes long-term patterns; weather tells us what happens today.

9
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:34,284
A single dry afternoon could not explain the whole problem.

